<title>JAPAN: MOTOR RACING-JAPAN TO STAGE INDYCAR RACE FROM 1998.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-JAPAN TO STAGE INDYCAR RACE FROM 1998.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan is to stage an IndyCar race for three years in succession, starting in 1998. </p>
<p>Twin Ring Motegi, a Honda subsidiary, said the venue would be a motor sports theme park being built 100 km north of Tokyo and due to open in August 1997. </p>
<p>The U.S.-based IndyCar series also stages races in Canada, Australia and Brazil.</p>
</text>
